  "content": "# 第32题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★★☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\nWhat does the word “enamored” underlined in Paragraph 3 most probably mean?\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. Shocked.\n\nB. B. Protected.\n\nC. C. Attracted.\n\nD. D. Challenged.\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nC\n\n",
  "answer": "D",
  "analysis": "本题考查代词。‘another’指三者或三者以上中的另一个；‘the other’指两者中的另一个。此处‘one...the other’是固定搭配，故选D。"
